{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception as a single automaton, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery from obstacles is handled by short turns. Only one controllable is enabled per non-terminal state, and all uncontrollables are total. Full_rotate is used only as a last-resort scan after repeated obstacles. The design avoids oscillations and ensures the robot returns to exploration quickly after recovery.",
